প্রশ্ন: 10x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - 1&nbsp;&nbsp;কে 2x - 1 দ্বারা ভাগ করলে পাওয়া যায়-&nbsp;<br /><br />সমাধান:&nbsp;<br />10x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - 1&nbsp;
<div>= 10x<sup>2</sup> + 2x - 5x - 1<br />= 2x(5x + 1) - 1(5x + 1)</div>
<div>= (5x + 1)(2x - 1)<br /><br />(10x<sup>2</sup> - 3x - 1)/(2x - 1) = &nbsp;(5x + 1)(2x - 1)/(2x - 1)<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; = (5x + 1)</div>

প্রশ্ন: x + 4/x = 4 হলে, (x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> এর মান কত?&nbsp;<br /><br />সমাধান:&nbsp;<br />দেয়া আছে,<br />x + 4/x = 4<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> + 4 = 4x<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - 4x + 4= 0<br />বা, x<sup>2</sup> - 2.x. 2 + 2<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />বা, (x - 2)<sup>2</sup> = 0<br />বা, x - 2 = 0<br />বা, x = 2<br /><br />x - 1/x = 2 - 1/2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= (4 - 1)/2<br />&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;= 3/2&nbsp;
<div>&nbsp;</div>
<div>(x - 1/x)<sup>2</sup> =&nbsp; (3/2)<sup>2</sup> = 9/4</div>
